        "@value": "Previous assertion that this one revises (version chain A1->A2->A3). Uses prov:wasRevisionOf (a derivation between entities); the latest assertion is the one with no incoming wasRevisionOf. NOTE: prov:invalidated was incorrect here (it is an Activity->Entity relation, not Entity->Entity)."
